      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Battles are fought using a turn-based card system. Each round, your three
    party members act one at a time, and each character may either play a single
    card or draw a card and skip their turn. Cards are discarded after use and only
    replenished by drawing. Different characters are better suited to different card
    types: the Hero excels at melee and physical attacks, the Mage is strongest with
    magic-based cards, and the Ranger specializes in healing and support abilities.
    After all party members have acted, the enemy takes its turn. Victory depends
    on managing your hand wisely, choosing the right character for each card, and
    timing support actions carefully.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9b6cbbaf262838e40a6f524d918e5053, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -342365872009247435, guid: 9b6cbbaf262838e40a6f524d918e5053, type: 2}
